<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to inject 1.456 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to inject 1.456 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to inject 1.456 billion pesos in the secondary market Thursday through one credit auction, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auction was offered as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM</p>
<p>   1.456 bln  1 day</p>
<p>*Amount in pesos</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom 525 728-9559</p>
</text>
